  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Human Rights-Driven Policy Advocacy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To ensure that human rights, particularly those of the marginalized and vulnerable groups, including women and youth, informal economy groups in urban communities, are protected through policy advocacy campaigns and data management of human rights reports using e-applications, during the age of COVID-19.</narrative>
  </description>
